    "finite_replay": "Root independently replayed all three unique edits, every intermediate hash and the complete byte inverse. Live and raw a6 preimage agree; all other fixture bytes remain exact.",
    "source_authority": "Root read the original Node typed Local<Object> callback-scope and Environment pointer ownership, the complete argument expression and operation Scope implementation, actual Boundary return retirement, CallbackScope initialization/push/deinit, and the complete SDK Completion implementation. All 13 SDK source pins and 17 exact raw excerpts were independently verified.",
